% An interactive session read from standard input: the program's own query
% runs first, then each line of repl-session.stdin is answered in turn, into
% the same output and with the same separators.  Blank lines and comments are
% ignored, and nothing after .quit is read.
edge(a, b).
edge(b, c).
edge(c, d).
path(X, Y) :- edge(X, Y).
path(X, Z) :- edge(X, Y), path(Y, Z).

path(a, X)?
